# Three-tube swarm pod: one trigger pull ejects the whole cluster for a single
# capacitor charge (muzzle_pattern salvo multiplies damage per pull by barrel count,
# so the per-round number is balanced for x3). The cluster fans from three offset
# tubes, coasts, then ignites together -- built to overwhelm a PD blink that could
# handle the rounds one at a time.
id          hydra_rack
name        "Hydra Swarm Rack"
kind        missile
size        M
icon        ic-missile
damage      11
reload      6.5
proj_speed  11000
proj_life   300
proj_radius 4.0
cap_cost    30
emission    0.85
proj_hp     1.2
price       1600
tier        2
engage_range 50000
eject_speed  400
ignition_delay 0.4
muzzle -0.6 1.1
muzzle  0.0 1.4
muzzle  0.6 1.1
muzzle_pattern salvo
desc "Three tubes, one pull. Each round is fragile alone; the cluster arrives together and asks the point-defense to be in three places at once."
